          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{3d^{-3}}{6d^{-1}}&=\\frac12d^{-2}\\\\\\frac{3d^{-3}}{6d^{-1}}&=\\frac{1}{2d^2}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 26
      },
      {
        "id": "p11-q2-o",
