        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{5}{6t^2}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{15t^{-4}}{18t^{-2}}&=\\frac56t^{-2}\\\\\\frac{15t^{-4}}{18t^{-2}}&=\\frac{5}{6t^2}\\end{align*}$$",
