        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{ay^3}{32}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(2a^{-2}y^3)^{-2}\\div(2ay^{-3})^3&=\\frac14a^4y^{-6}\\div8a^3y^{-9}\\\\(2a^{-2}y^3)^{-2}\\div(2ay^{-3})^3&=\\frac1{32}a^{4-3}y^{-6-(-9)}\\\\(2a^{-2}y^3)^{-2}\\div(2ay^{-3})^3&=\\frac{ay^3}{32}\\end{align*}$$",
